{%- comment -%}
  Renders the "Due separately to National Gym Service" summary in the cart and
  the cart drawer, and nothing at all when the cart holds no NGS service.

  Why the amount is not taken from the cart line price. Once the Cart Transform
  that defers these services is deployed, the NGS line sits in the cart at
  $0.00, so summing line prices would report nothing owed. The amount owed is
  therefore read from the same trusted `fs_bundle.ngs_allowlist` shop metafield
  the function and the PDP read, which holds the approved amount per variant.
  That also means this block shows the correct figure both before and after the
  function is deployed.

  Accepts:
    - context: {String} 'drawer' or 'page', used only for the wrapper class.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign ngs_options = shop.metafields.fs_bundle.ngs_allowlist.value.options -%}

{%- if ngs_options.size > 0 and cart.item_count > 0 -%}
  {%- assign ngs_total_cents = 0 -%}
  {%- assign ngs_line_count = 0 -%}

  {%- comment -%}
    The selected options are NOT separate cart lines. The Cart Transform
    expands the bundle further down the funnel, so `cart.items` holds only the
    parent variant, and the customer's choices live on that line's private
    `_functionOperation` property as JSON. Liquid cannot parse JSON, but the
    property does contain each selected variant's full GID, so a containment
    test against the allowlist's variant ids is enough to identify them. The
    ids are fixed-length and unique, so one cannot be a substring of another.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- for item in cart.items -%}
    {%- assign selection = item.properties['_functionOperation'] -%}
    {%- if selection != blank -%}
      {%- for entry in ngs_options -%}
        {%- assign entry_variant_id = entry.variantId | split: '/' | last -%}
        {%- if selection contains entry_variant_id -%}
          {%- assign line_cents = entry.price | times: 100 | times: item.quantity -%}
          {%- assign ngs_total_cents = ngs_total_cents | plus: line_cents -%}
          {%- assign ngs_line_count = ngs_line_count | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}

  {%- if ngs_line_count > 0 -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Styles live with the snippet so the block looks the same in the drawer and
      on the cart page without depending on which stylesheet either surface
      happens to load. Matches the PDP block in .ngs-due-line.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <style>
      .ngs-cart-summary {
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        padding: 10px 12px;
        background-color: #eef4fb;
        border: 1px solid #b9d2ea;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 20px;
        color: #23232b;
        text-align: left;
      }
      .ngs-cart-summary__row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .ngs-cart-summary__label { font-weight: 700; }
      .ngs-cart-summary__value {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1c4e80;
        white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .ngs-cart-summary__note {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 18px;
        color: #4a4a55;
      }
    </style>
    <div class="ngs-cart-summary ngs-cart-summary--{{ context | default: 'page' }}" data-ngs-cart-summary>
      <div class="ngs-cart-summary__row">
        <span class="ngs-cart-summary__label">Due separately to National Gym Service:</span>
        <span class="ngs-cart-summary__value">{{ ngs_total_cents | money }}</span>
      </div>
      <p class="ngs-cart-summary__note">
        {%- if ngs_line_count == 1 -%}
          This service is
        {%- else -%}
          These {{ ngs_line_count }} services are
        {%- endif -%}
        not included in the amount billed today by Fitness Superstore. National
        Gym Service LLC will contact you after your order to arrange payment.
        Installation is scheduled, and a paid extended warranty starts, once
        that payment is confirmed.
      </p>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
